# Runtime Dependency Modifications for HarmonyOS
# These are NOT source-level patches but post-install modifications to dependency packages.
# They are applied after pip install and ELF signing, during the packaging process.
#
# 1. rpds/__init__.py: ctypes preload bundled libgcc_s (RPATH $ORIGIN not resolved by HarmonyOS ldso)
# 2. regress/__init__.py: ctypes preload bundled libgcc_s
# 3. charset_normalizer/__init__.py: ctypes preload bundled libgcc_s
# 4. All .so files: ELF signing via ohc-run.py sign-elf
#
# These modifications are included in the precompiled package tar.gz.
